OL,3,ARussell Brand arrives at court for
OL,4,Astart of rape trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FRussell Brand has arrived at court for
OL,7,Fthe start of his rape and sexual
OL,8,Fassault trial.
OL,10,FThe 51-year-old comedian and actor has
OL,11,Fbeen charged with three counts of rape,
OL,12,Fthree charges of sexual assault and one
OL,13,Fallegation of indecent assault, which
OL,14,Fare alleged to have occurred between
OL,15,F1999 and 2009.
OL,17,FThe trial at Southwark Crown Court,
OL,18,Fwhich could last up to 10 weeks, is
OL,19,Fexpected to begin with the process of
OL,20,Fjury selection on Monday morning.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
